#: includes/doroto-tournament-management.php:2436
msgid "Example 4: Beach Volleyball, completed tournament"
msgstr "Eksempel 4: sandvolleyball, avsluttet turnering"

#: includes/doroto-tournament-management.php:2267
msgid "Example 3: Singles Badminton, final match"
msgstr "Eksempel 3: badminton single, finalekamp"

#: includes/doroto-tournament-management.php:2170
msgid "Example 2: Doubles Padel, closed registration"
msgstr "Eksempel 2: padel double, påmelding stengt"

#: includes/doroto-tournament-management.php:2087
msgid "Example 1: Doubles Tennis, open registration"
msgstr "Eksempel 1: tennis double, påmelding åpen"

#: includes/doroto-tournament-management.php:2071
msgid "Each time you run the help, a new tournament with the same settings will be randomly generated."
msgstr "Hver gang du starter hjelpen, opprettes det tilfeldig en ny turnering med de samme innstillingene."

#: includes/doroto-tournament-management.php:2070
msgid "You can do whatever you want with this tournament. Change its settings, enter match results, and eventually delete it."
msgstr "Du kan gjøre hva du vil med denne turneringen. Endre innstillingene, legg inn kampresultater og slett den til slutt."

#: includes/doroto-tournament-management.php:2069
msgid "Several accounts of well-known tennis players were automatically created for testing purposes."
msgstr "For testing er det automatisk opprettet kontoer for flere kjente tennisspillere."

#: includes/doroto-tournament-management.php:2068
msgid "This tournament was created for you to understand the functionality of the system using examples of different tournament settings."
msgstr "Denne turneringen er opprettet for at du skal forstå hvordan systemet fungerer, ved hjelp av eksempler på ulike turneringsinnstillinger."

#: includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:3766
msgid "At least one tournament example is missing!"
msgstr "Minst én eksempelturnering mangler!"

#: includes/doroto-blocks.php:225 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:2527
msgid "Winner"
msgstr "Vinner"

#: includes/doroto-repeated-functions.php:62
msgid "You might need a little help. You can start by clicking the floating help icon on the right."
msgstr "Kanskje trenger du litt hjelp. Begynn med å klikke på det svevende hjelpeikonet til høyre."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:437
msgid "Finally, your filter was canceled so that it would not unexpectedly affect other tournaments."
msgstr "Til slutt ble filteret ditt fjernet, slik at det ikke uventet påvirker andre turneringer."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:436 includes/doroto-help.php:279
msgid "Do you know how many more matches would have to be played to ensure a rotation of serve? That is, each pair would play each other twice to alternate serving? Try changing this parameter and see."
msgstr "Vet du hvor mange flere kamper som måtte spilles for å sikre at serven veksler? Altså at hvert par møtes to ganger for å bytte serve? Prøv å endre denne parameteren og se."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:435 includes/doroto-help.php:276
msgid "Looking at the game statistics of the selected man, we see that he actually played with every player. Moreover, the system ensured an even rotation of serve."
msgstr "Statistikken for den valgte mannen viser at han faktisk har spilt med hver spiller. I tillegg har systemet sørget for en jevn veksling av serven."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:434 includes/doroto-help.php:275
msgid "Unlike players from the special group (meaning women here), men played 2 more matches."
msgstr "I motsetning til spillerne i spesialgruppen (her kvinnene) spilte mennene 2 kamper mer."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:433
msgid "This is a man who was randomly selected for us to look at his results."
msgstr "Dette er en tilfeldig valgt mann som vi ser på resultatene til."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:432 includes/doroto-help.php:274
msgid "Let's set the filter to one of the men."
msgstr "La oss sette filteret på en av mennene."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:431 includes/doroto-help.php:271
msgid "The end of a tournament round can be recognized when the players have no matches left. However, in doubles, a situation is also allowed where a maximum of 3 players have 1 match left. In this case, it is not possible to find 4 players who have not played together before."
msgstr "Slutten på en turneringsrunde kjennes igjen på at spillerne ikke har flere kamper igjen. I double er det likevel tillatt at maksimalt 3 spillere har 1 kamp igjen. Da er det ikke mulig å finne 4 spillere som ikke har spilt sammen før."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:430 includes/doroto-help.php:268
msgid "Thus, the tournament round was closed, from which we required everyone to play with everyone, provided that the settings allowed it."
msgstr "Dermed ble turneringsrunden avsluttet, der vi ønsket at alle skulle spille med alle, så langt innstillingene tillot det."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:429 includes/doroto-help.php:268
msgid "This table shows that the woman who was actually selected did not pair up with another woman, but only with men. At the same time, she played one match with each man."
msgstr "Denne tabellen viser at den valgte kvinnen ikke dannet par med en annen kvinne, bare med menn. Samtidig spilte hun én kamp med hver mann."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:428
msgid "Here the number of matches played as a teammate and opponent is added up."
msgstr "Her summeres antall kamper spilt som makker og som motstander."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:427 includes/doroto-help.php:267
msgid "This column reports the number of matches played where the player listed in this row was in the opposing position."
msgstr "Denne kolonnen viser antall spilte kamper der spilleren på denne raden var på motstandersiden."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:426 includes/doroto-help.php:266
msgid "This column reports the number of matches played where the player listed in this row was a teammate of the selected woman on the right."
msgstr "Denne kolonnen viser antall spilte kamper der spilleren på denne raden var den valgte kvinnens makker til høyre."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:425 includes/doroto-help.php:265
msgid "This column reports the number of matches played where the player listed in this row was a teammate of the selected woman on the left."
msgstr "Denne kolonnen viser antall spilte kamper der spilleren på denne raden var den valgte kvinnens makker til venstre."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:424 includes/doroto-help.php:264
msgid "The statistical data can be read line by line. The player's name is at the beginning."
msgstr "Statistikken kan leses rad for rad. Spillerens navn står først."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:423 includes/doroto-help.php:264
msgid "Here are the statistics of this woman's games played."
msgstr "Her er statistikken for denne kvinnens kamper."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:422
msgid "I remind you that this woman was chosen to filter the matches and create statistics."
msgstr "Husk at denne kvinnen ble valgt for å filtrere kampene og lage statistikken."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:421 includes/doroto-help.php:263
msgid "Let's look at the matches played by a selected woman from a special group. She actually played matches only with male colleagues, but the opponent could be not only a man + woman group, but also a man + man."
msgstr "La oss se på kampene til en valgt kvinne fra spesialgruppen. Hun spilte bare med menn som makkere, men motstanderne kunne være både et par mann + kvinne og mann + mann."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:420 includes/doroto-help.php:258
msgid "Another setting allows you to create pairs between members outside of special groups. In our case, you can create male + male pairs."
msgstr "En annen innstilling tillater par mellom spillere utenfor spesialgruppen. I vårt tilfelle kan det dannes par mann + mann."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:419 includes/doroto-help.php:257
msgid "This setting determines that there will be no 2 from the special group in the pair. That is, no woman + woman pairs will be created."
msgstr "Denne innstillingen bestemmer at det ikke blir 2 spillere fra spesialgruppen i et par. Det dannes altså ingen par kvinne + kvinne."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:418 includes/doroto-help.php:256
msgid "Now let's look at the number of matches played by individual players. There are significant differences. These are caused by the special group settings."
msgstr "La oss nå se på antall spilte kamper for hver spiller. Det er store forskjeller. De skyldes innstillingene for spesialgruppen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:417 includes/doroto-help.php:254
msgid "The tournament has already been closed because the tournament round has ended."
msgstr "Turneringen er allerede stengt fordi turneringsrunden er over."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:416 includes/doroto-help.php:253
msgid "Tennis players, 3 men and 3 women, decided to play beach volleyball."
msgstr "Tennisspillere, 3 menn og 3 kvinner, bestemte seg for å spille sandvolleyball."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:415
msgid "If you are not logged in to your account, you will not see an important part of this example."
msgstr "Hvis du ikke er logget inn på kontoen din, ser du ikke en viktig del av dette eksemplet."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:414 includes/doroto-help.php:262
msgid "One of the female players was randomly selected and a filter was set based on that."
msgstr "En av spillerne ble valgt tilfeldig, og det ble satt et filter ut fra henne."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:413
msgid "Preparing help"
msgstr "Klargjør hjelpen"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:411 includes/doroto-help.php:246
msgid "If someone incorrectly enters the result of a match, the tournament organizer can correct the result."
msgstr "Hvis noen legger inn feil kampresultat, kan turneringsarrangøren rette det."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:410
msgid "If you have a filter set for a specific player, you can view their detailed statistical data."
msgstr "Hvis du har satt et filter på en bestemt spiller, kan du se den detaljerte statistikken for spilleren."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:409
msgid "Results can be filtered by player. You can only filter results after logging into your account."
msgstr "Resultatene kan filtreres etter spiller. Du kan bare filtrere etter at du har logget inn på kontoen din."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:408 includes/doroto-help.php:147 includes/doroto-help.php:244
msgid "Here you can find a table with all the matches played."
msgstr "Her finner du en tabell med alle spilte kamper."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:407 includes/doroto-help.php:243
msgid "To prevent an absent player from being declared the winner, this option can be disabled."
msgstr "For å unngå at en fraværende spiller kåres til vinner, kan dette alternativet slås av."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:406 includes/doroto-help.php:242
msgid "It is also not necessary to play all the matches to complete the round. Perhaps Iga Swiatek and Novak Djokovic will not be coming and so the round-robin game could not be completed."
msgstr "Det er heller ikke nødvendig å spille alle kampene for å fullføre runden. Kanskje kommer ikke Iga Swiatek og Novak Djokovic, og da kunne ikke alle-mot-alle fullføres."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:405 includes/doroto-help.php:241
msgid "It is important to understand that the total number of matches played does not affect the ranking. What matters is the ratio of points won and lost."
msgstr "Det er viktig å forstå at det totale antallet spilte kamper ikke påvirker stillingen. Det som teller, er forholdet mellom vunne og tapte poeng."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:404
msgid "The fact that Iga Swiatek and Novak Djokovic still have a suspended game can be seen by the check box next to their names."
msgstr "At Iga Swiatek og Novak Djokovic fortsatt har spillet sitt på pause, ser du av avmerkingsboksen ved navnene deres."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:403 includes/doroto-help.php:239
msgid "The overview shows that the players played a different number of matches due to the fact that Iga Swiatek and Novak Djokovic decided to interrupt the tournament sometime in the middle."
msgstr "Oversikten viser at spillerne har spilt ulikt antall kamper fordi Iga Swiatek og Novak Djokovic bestemte seg for å avbryte turneringen omtrent halvveis."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:402 includes/doroto-help.php:237
msgid "At the same time, the winner in the best player of the tournament category was announced."
msgstr "Samtidig ble vinneren i kategorien turneringens beste spiller kunngjort."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:401 includes/doroto-help.php:238
msgid "The tournament has already ended with the announcement of the winners in the most ideal couple category."
msgstr "Turneringen ble allerede avsluttet med kunngjøringen av vinnerne i kategorien det mest ideelle paret."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:400 includes/doroto-help.php:236
msgid "The 12 world-famous tennis players from the previous examples decided to play singles badminton, regardless of gender."
msgstr "De 12 verdenskjente tennisspillerne fra de forrige eksemplene bestemte seg for å spille badminton single uavhengig av kjønn."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:398 includes/doroto-help.php:146 includes/doroto-help.php:220
msgid "However, this can only be done by the player playing the game, the tournament organizer, or the website administrator."
msgstr "Dette kan likevel bare gjøres av en spiller i kampen, turneringsarrangøren eller nettstedsadministratoren."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:397 includes/doroto-help.php:220
msgid "Button to save results. Pressing this button will draw the next match according to the settings."
msgstr "Knapp for å lagre resultatene. Når du trykker på den, trekkes neste kamp etter innstillingene."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:396 includes/doroto-help.php:220
msgid "Field for entering game results."
msgstr "Felt for å legge inn resultater."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:395
msgid "The match can be skipped by checking this box and pressing the Save button."
msgstr "Kampen kan hoppes over ved å krysse av i denne boksen og trykke på knappen Lagre."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:394
msgid "Player of team 2 on the right side of the court."
msgstr "Spiller fra lag 2 på høyre side av banen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:393
msgid "Player of team 2 on the left side of the court."
msgstr "Spiller fra lag 2 på venstre side av banen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:392
msgid "Player of team 1 on the right side of the court. This player starts the game by serving."
msgstr "Spiller fra lag 1 på høyre side av banen. Denne spilleren starter partiet med serven."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:391
msgid "Player of team 1 on the left side of the court."
msgstr "Spiller fra lag 1 på venstre side av banen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:390
msgid "In each column of the table you will find the match number."
msgstr "I hver kolonne i tabellen finner du kampnummeret."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:389 includes/doroto-help.php:145 includes/doroto-help.php:217
msgid "Here, individual matches are drawn in a number corresponding to the selected number of available courts or playing surfaces."
msgstr "Her trekkes de enkelte kampene i et antall som tilsvarer det valgte antallet tilgjengelige baner eller spilleflater."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:388
msgid "To make the tournament prediction reliable, you must check and possibly adjust the parameters marked with *."
msgstr "For at turneringsprognosen skal være pålitelig, må du kontrollere og eventuelt justere parameterne som er merket med *."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:387 includes/doroto-help.php:216
msgid "However, if you request the end of the tournament round, an estimated time for the tournament will be displayed."
msgstr "Hvis du derimot ønsker å nå slutten av turneringsrunden, vises en beregnet tid for turneringen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:386 includes/doroto-help.php:228
msgid "In the settings you can choose whether the tournament targets the end of the round and whether the service rotation is taken into account. The end of the round does not have to be tracked according to the settings."
msgstr "I innstillingene kan du velge om turneringen sikter mot slutten av runden, og om det tas hensyn til veksling av serven. Avhengig av innstillingene trenger ikke slutten av runden å følges."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:385 includes/doroto-help.php:227
msgid "If the goal of the tournament is to close the round, the remaining number of matches for each player is displayed here."
msgstr "Hvis målet med turneringen er å avslutte runden, vises her gjenstående antall kamper for hver spiller."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:384 includes/doroto-help.php:226
msgid "The trend shows how many matches in a row ended in a win or loss."
msgstr "Trenden viser hvor mange kamper på rad som endte med seier eller tap."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:383 includes/doroto-help.php:225
msgid "The ratio between games won and lost (points) determines the overall ranking among players."
msgstr "Forholdet mellom vunne og tapte partier (poeng) avgjør spillernes samlede plassering."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:382 includes/doroto-help.php:224
msgid "Similarly, each player has a total of all lost games or points."
msgstr "På samme måte har hver spiller en sum av alle tapte partier eller poeng."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:381 includes/doroto-help.php:223
msgid "For each player, we will find the total number of games won, or points in another type of game."
msgstr "For hver spiller finner vi det totale antallet vunne partier eller, i andre spilltyper, poeng."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:380 includes/doroto-help.php:229
msgid "The required number of matches played for a player to be declared the winner is set here."
msgstr "Her angis antallet spilte kamper som kreves for at en spiller skal kunne kåres til vinner."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:379 includes/doroto-help.php:222
msgid "Each player has played 3 or 4 matches so far. For those who have only played 3 matches, a '!' appears after the number, indicating that the player has not yet played enough matches to be declared the winner."
msgstr "Hver spiller har så langt spilt 3 eller 4 kamper. For dem som bare har spilt 3 kamper, vises et «!» etter tallet, som betyr at spilleren ennå ikke har spilt nok kamper til å kåres til vinner."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:377
msgid "Click this floating icon to view help. It will guide you through the various options for how a rotation tournament works and how to set them up."
msgstr "Klikk på dette svevende ikonet for å vise hjelpen. Den guider deg gjennom de ulike mulighetene for hvordan en rotasjonsturnering fungerer og hvordan du stiller dem inn."

#: build/blocks/tournament/render.php:626 doubles-rotation-tournament.php:376 src/blocks/tournament/render.php:626
msgid "Do you need advice?"
msgstr "Trenger du råd?"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:375 includes/doroto-help.php:210
msgid "If the tournament organizer records entry fee payments, the information about received payments is processed here."
msgstr "Hvis turneringsarrangøren registrerer betaling av startkontingent, behandles opplysningene om mottatte betalinger her."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:374 includes/doroto-help.php:203
msgid "As a tournament organizer, you can place selected players in a special group. For example, here all women are in a special group. The name of the player in the special group will be highlighted in color."
msgstr "Som turneringsarrangør kan du plassere utvalgte spillere i en spesialgruppe. Her er for eksempel alle kvinner i en spesialgruppe. Navnet på en spiller i spesialgruppen utheves med farge."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:373 includes/doroto-help.php:200
msgid "This link will only be available to other players when player registration is open."
msgstr "Denne lenken er bare tilgjengelig for andre spillere mens påmeldingen er åpen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:372 includes/doroto-help.php:207
msgid "Here, the tournament organizer can add players to the tournament from the player database individually, even during the tournament. For reasons of personal data protection, access to the database may be restricted by the website administrator."
msgstr "Her kan turneringsarrangøren legge til spillere enkeltvis fra spillerdatabasen, også underveis i turneringen. Av personvernhensyn kan nettstedsadministratoren begrense tilgangen til databasen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:371 includes/doroto-help.php:206
msgid "The administrator can pause and resume the game of any player. A player can only change himself. The interruption of the game by a player is shown in the table above."
msgstr "Administratoren kan sette spillet til enhver spiller på pause og gjenoppta det. En spiller kan bare endre seg selv. En spillers avbrudd i spillet vises i tabellen ovenfor."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:370 includes/doroto-help.php:153 includes/doroto-help.php:206
msgid "Pausing the game, adding players to the tournament, managing special groups and payments are all done in this section."
msgstr "Pause i spillet, å legge til spillere i turneringen og administrasjon av spesialgrupper og betalinger gjøres i denne delen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:369 includes/doroto-help.php:205
msgid "The tournament organizer can keep statistics on entry fee payments. Here, the 2nd, 4th, and 6th players paid."
msgstr "Turneringsarrangøren kan føre statistikk over betaling av startkontingent. Her har 2., 4. og 6. spiller betalt."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:368 includes/doroto-help.php:204
msgid "Players can interrupt the game at any time during the tournament and will not be placed in matches during the interruption. Here the game was interrupted by the 4th player."
msgstr "Spillere kan når som helst avbryte spillet under turneringen og blir ikke satt opp i kamper under avbruddet. Her har 4. spiller avbrutt spillet."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:367 includes/doroto-help.php:139 includes/doroto-help.php:202
msgid "The name of the tournament organizer, who can make all the settings, can be found here."
msgstr "Her finner du navnet på turneringsarrangøren, som kan gjøre alle innstillinger."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:366 includes/doroto-help.php:200
msgid "You can register for this tournament also via this link."
msgstr "Du kan også melde deg på denne turneringen via denne lenken."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:365
msgid "Registration for the tournament is closed."
msgstr "Påmeldingen til turneringen er stengt."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:364 includes/doroto-help.php:198
msgid "Registration for the tournament is still open."
msgstr "Påmeldingen til turneringen er fortsatt åpen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:363 includes/doroto-help.php:199
msgid "13 world-class tennis players, 7 men and 6 women, have registered for this tournament."
msgstr "13 tennisspillere i verdensklasse, 7 menn og 6 kvinner, har meldt seg på denne turneringen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:361 includes/doroto-help.php:112 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:3781
msgid "Example 4: doubles completed"
msgstr "Eksempel 4: double avsluttet"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:360 includes/doroto-help.php:111 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:3780
msgid "Example 3: singles completed"
msgstr "Eksempel 3: single avsluttet"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:359 includes/doroto-help.php:110 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:3779
msgid "Example 2: during the tournament"
msgstr "Eksempel 2: under turneringen"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:358 includes/doroto-help.php:109 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:3778
msgid "Example 1: open registration"
msgstr "Eksempel 1: påmelding åpen"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:356 includes/doroto-help.php:161
msgid "Administrator privileges can be extended to other people."
msgstr "Administratorrettigheter kan utvides til andre personer."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:355 includes/doroto-help.php:160
msgid "Changes must be saved using this button. Only the tournament administrator has this permission."
msgstr "Endringer må lagres med denne knappen. Bare turneringsadministratoren har denne tillatelsen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:354 includes/doroto-help.php:158 includes/doroto-help.php:209
msgid "Settings that allow you to create different pairs, such as man + woman, adult + child, etc."
msgstr "Innstillinger som gjør det mulig å danne ulike par, f.eks. mann + kvinne, voksen + barn osv."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:353 includes/doroto-help.php:157
msgid "Variables that help estimate the length of the tournament."
msgstr "Variabler som hjelper med å anslå turneringens lengde."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:352 includes/doroto-help.php:156 includes/doroto-help.php:230
msgid "Here you can enter the number of courts that are available, edit the name of the tournament and the type of tournament."
msgstr "Her kan du angi antall tilgjengelige baner og redigere turneringens navn og type."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:351
msgid "Under these tabs you will find all possible settings of the selected tournament."
msgstr "Under disse fanene finner du alle mulige innstillinger for den valgte turneringen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:350 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:3776
msgid "Advance tournament management"
msgstr "Avansert turneringsadministrasjon"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:348
msgid "...or you can use this option...."
msgstr "…eller du kan bruke dette alternativet…"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:347 includes/doroto-help.php:155
msgid "When enough matches have been played, the organizer can end the tournament here."
msgstr "Når nok kamper er spilt, kan arrangøren avslutte turneringen her."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:346
msgid "Only the tournament administrator can make these adjustments."
msgstr "Bare turneringsadministratoren kan gjøre disse justeringene."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:345 includes/doroto-help.php:155 includes/doroto-help.php:208
msgid "If enough players have registered for the tournament, the organizer can close the registration of new players."
msgstr "Hvis nok spillere har meldt seg på, kan arrangøren stenge påmeldingen for nye spillere."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:344 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:3775
msgid "Basic tournament management"
msgstr "Grunnleggende turneringsadministrasjon"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:342 includes/doroto-help.php:148
msgid "The list of registered players and later the current ranking can be found here."
msgstr "Her finner du listen over påmeldte spillere og senere den aktuelle stillingen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:341
msgid "This shows the number of players logged in. If you also see a number after the slash, this indicates the maximum number of players set by the tournament organizer."
msgstr "Viser antall påmeldte spillere. Hvis du også ser et tall etter skråstreken, er det det høyeste antallet spillere som turneringsarrangøren har satt."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:340
msgid "You can select the tournament with which you will continue to work by clicking on its name. A colored background means that this tournament has already been selected."
msgstr "Klikk på navnet for å velge turneringen du skal jobbe videre med. En farget bakgrunn betyr at turneringen allerede er valgt."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:339
msgid "Because player registration for the tournament has already been closed, this link is inactive."
msgstr "Fordi påmeldingen av spillere til turneringen allerede er stengt, er denne lenken inaktiv."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:338 includes/doroto-help.php:140
msgid "For the selected tournament, you can log in or log out here."
msgstr "Her kan du melde deg på eller av den valgte turneringen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:337 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:3774
msgid "Tournament registration"
msgstr "Påmelding til turneringen"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:335 includes/doroto-help.php:180
msgid "If you log in to your account and we run this tutorial again, I will grant you tournament organizer rights. If you can try out other options in this trial tournament."
msgstr "Hvis du logger inn på kontoen din og vi kjører denne veiledningen på nytt, gir jeg deg arrangørrettigheter for turneringen. Da kan du prøve andre alternativer i denne prøveturneringen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:333
msgid "We will demonstrate this tip on a selected tournament example."
msgstr "Vi viser dette tipset med en valgt eksempelturnering."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:332
msgid "Redirect"
msgstr "Send videre"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:331
msgid "The settings have been made, you just need to reload the page."
msgstr "Innstillingene er gjort, du trenger bare å laste inn siden på nytt."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:330
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Last inn på nytt"

#: build/blocks/tournament/render.php:607 doubles-rotation-tournament.php:329 src/blocks/tournament/render.php:607
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Avbryt"

#: build/blocks/tournament/render.php:620 build/blocks/tournament/render.php:637 doubles-rotation-tournament.php:328 includes/doroto-blocks.php:63 src/blocks/tournament/render.php:620 src/blocks/tournament/render.php:637
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Lukk"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:327 includes/doroto-blocks.php:62
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Tilbake"

#: build/blocks/tournament-list/render.php:86 doubles-rotation-tournament.php:326 includes/doroto-blocks.php:61 src/blocks/tournament-list/render.php:86
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Neste"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:325
msgid "Register"
msgstr "Registrer"

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:323
msgid "You are not yet listed as an organizer in this tournament. To make things easier for you, I will list your name among the tournament organizers."
msgstr "Du står ennå ikke som arrangør i denne turneringen. For å gjøre det enklere for deg legger jeg til navnet ditt blant turneringens arrangører."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:322
msgid "If you were logged into your account, you can now see your name among the tournament organizers and have permission to make changes to the settings."
msgstr "Hvis du var logget inn på kontoen din, ser du nå navnet ditt blant turneringens arrangører og har tillatelse til å endre innstillingene."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:321
msgid "The newly created tournament will have this background color. The tournament marked in this way is displayed in all tables above."
msgstr "Den nyopprettede turneringen får denne bakgrunnsfargen. Turneringen som er merket slik, vises i alle tabellene ovenfor."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:320
msgid "The newly created tournament will appear at the top of the table of available tournaments."
msgstr "Den nyopprettede turneringen vises øverst i tabellen over tilgjengelige turneringer."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:319
msgid "Press this button and the tournament will be created."
msgstr "Trykk på denne knappen, så opprettes turneringen."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:318
msgid "First, select the type of tournament you want to create."
msgstr "Velg først hvilken type turnering du vil opprette."

#: doubles-rotation-tournament.php:317
msgid "End of preparation. Let's get started!"
msgstr "Forberedelsene er ferdige. La oss begynne!"

#: includes/doroto-tournament-management.php:3166
msgid "points"
msgstr "poeng"

#: includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:2811
msgid "Variables used for estimating the end of the tournament."
msgstr "Variabler for å anslå turneringens slutt."

#: includes/doroto-blocks.php:202 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:2351
msgid "How many games (points) are played per hour on one court (table)?"
msgstr "Hvor mange partier (poeng) spilles per time på én bane (ett bord)?"

#: includes/doroto-blocks.php:199 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:2325
msgid "Yes, but don't consider service rotation."
msgstr "Ja, men uten hensyn til veksling av serven."

#: includes/doroto-blocks.php:196 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:2304
msgid "If you play tennis and your matches end with an average score of 6:4, then enter a value of 10."
msgstr "Hvis du spiller tennis og kampene dine i gjennomsnitt ender 6:4, skriver du inn verdien 10."

#: includes/doroto-blocks.php:196 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:2303
msgid "Average match result."
msgstr "Gjennomsnittlig kampresultat."

#: build/blocks/tournament/render.php:363 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:576 src/blocks/tournament/render.php:363
msgid "Residue"
msgstr "Gjenstår"

#: build/blocks/tournament/render.php:359 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:565 src/blocks/tournament/render.php:359
msgid "Lost"
msgstr "Tapt"

#: build/blocks/tournament/render.php:358 includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:565 src/blocks/tournament/render.php:358
msgid "Won"
msgstr "Vunnet"

#: includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:85
msgid "Estimated time to finish:"
msgstr "Beregnet tid til slutt:"

#: includes/doroto-shortcodes.php:38
msgid "Tournament progress calculation is not available."
msgstr "Beregning av turneringens fremdrift er ikke tilgjengelig."

#: includes/doroto-admin.php:76
msgid "How many points are played on one court (field) in 1 hour on average."
msgstr "Hvor mange poeng som i gjennomsnitt spilles på én bane i løpet av 1 time."

#: includes/doroto-admin.php:75
msgid "Average total points per game. E.g. with an average result of 6:4, the average total is 10."
msgstr "Gjennomsnittlig samlet antall poeng per parti. F.eks. ved et gjennomsnittlig resultat på 6:4 er gjennomsnittet 10."

#: includes/doroto-admin.php:71
msgid "Average number of points played per hour"
msgstr "Gjennomsnittlig antall spilte poeng per time"

#: includes/doroto-admin.php:70
msgid "Total average points in one game"
msgstr "Gjennomsnittlig samlet antall poeng i ett parti"

#: includes/doroto-admin.php:69
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Synlighet"

